&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;
&lt;code&gt;[[size 200%]][[[Link | FP-##]]] | Name[[/size]]

**Area Class:** ##purple|**Free Port**##

**Description:** //A short description regarding the Free Port//

**Associated Articles:**
