&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hotcocoanerd&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2032511&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606099685&quot; alt=&quot;HotCocoaNerd&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2032511)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hotcocoanerd&quot;  &gt;HotCocoaNerd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. For those of you who think it&#039;s Nexii, please see the discussion thread&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. An exception would be Nx-03, Hy-Brasil with a former population of just over a 100,000&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Someone&#039;s already done that idea, unfortunately&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Think Diagon Alley from Harry Potter.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Shapeshift in layman terms&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Known anomalies include gravity reversal in Main Street every Tuesday at 12.00 p.m., a colony of sentient, talking praying mantises and individuals meeting misfortune upon saying the phrase &amp;quot;What could possibly go wrong?&amp;quot; or variants of it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Unclassed Anomalous Entities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. Humanoid Anomalous Constructs&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. A Web forum comprised of conspiracy theorists, paranormal enthusiasts and amateur writers with no knowledge of the Veil&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. A member of the GOC&#039;s Council of 108&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. This Nexus was created by SCP-KO branch; the K in the name means Korea.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. Unusual Incidents Unit&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-465106-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. Another member of the GOC&#039;s Council of 108&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
