partment<br /> Status: Active<br /> Reason: 45+ years anomalous pathogen research<br /> Service: 45+ years research and testing w/ Foundation assets</p> <p>Name: Rs. Daniel Earl Doe<br /> Location: Site-19, pending permanent assignment<br /> Status: Active<br /> Reason: 4 years research into anomalous foods/food products<br /> Service: Recent recruitment c. 2013</p> </blockquote> <p>Overall personnel count: <strong>10</strong><br /> Operations personnel: <strong>5</strong><br /> Research personnel: <strong>5</strong></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p>This is a mixed bag, but I think we do need to address this seriously. Don't give them too much free reins, keep them held tight. Let's have a play with this one, shall we?</p> <p><em>O5-5</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/acal" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2671776&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606099693" alt="ACal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2671776)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/acal" >ACal</a></span></p> 
