&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-assessment&quot;&gt;Assessment&lt;/a&gt; - Assessment Team &amp;quot;Sparkplug&amp;quot; goes on their first mission with a new member, and Council politics raise their ugly head.&lt;/li&gt;
