&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-special-observer&quot;&gt;Special Observer&lt;/a&gt; - Knight and Zhao and the Temple of Doom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-farpoint&quot;&gt;Farpoint&lt;/a&gt; - Callahan arrives at a GOC forward operating base for his new assignment, and makes some friends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-awtok&quot;&gt;AWTOK&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;FUCK YOU I&#039;M A DRAGON&amp;quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-joint-venture&quot;&gt;Joint Venture&lt;/a&gt; - Just add white doves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-trauma&quot;&gt;Trauma&lt;/a&gt; - Scars and memories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-tempering&quot;&gt;Tempering&lt;/a&gt; - It&#039;s not always the hottest flame that makes the best steel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-vigil&quot;&gt;Vigil&lt;/a&gt; - For the Fallen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/goc-tale-sequence-diplomacy&quot;&gt;Diplomacy&lt;/a&gt; - Visiting prisoners of war is one of the duties of the International Red Cross.&lt;/li&gt;
